            {
              "text": " = 1.76 s"
            },
            {
              "sup": true,
              "text": "-1"
            },
            {
              "text": " at 273 K. If the activation energy, "
            },
            {
              "em": true,
              "text": "E"
            },
            {
              "em": true,
              "sub": true,
              "text": "a"
            },
            {
              "text": " = 15.0 kJ/mol, then what is the rate constant for the reaction at 298 K?"
            }
          ],
          "id": "gshfvbekb62hnm8",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "children": [
